---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { canonicalUrl } from '../lib/seo';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | AI Live Video"
  description="How AI Live Video approaches links and possible affiliate disclosures."
  canonicalPath="/affiliate-disclosure/"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: canonicalUrl('/') }, { name: 'Affiliate Disclosure' }]}
>
  <article class="container trust-page">
    <header class="trust-page__hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Affiliate disclosure</p>
      <h1>Clear context for links</h1>
      <p>Links may help readers reach a provider's website or official information.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Current position</h2>
      <p>We do not state that any current link is an affiliate link or that any affiliate relationship exists. If that changes, we will identify the affected link or page with a clear disclosure.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
      <p>Potential compensation and any affiliate relationships do not determine our editorial conclusions. We aim to describe evidence and limitations plainly, including where information is unavailable or uncertain.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Reader choice</h2>
      <p>External links are provided for convenience. Readers can choose whether to visit them and should review a provider's current information before purchasing or using a service.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .trust-page { padding-bottom: 4rem; } .trust-page__hero { max-width: 48rem; padding-block: 2rem 3rem; } .trust-page__hero > p:last-child { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; } .trust-page section { max-width: 48rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); } .trust-page h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
</style>
